    filer</ix:nonNumeric></span> &#9746;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 32%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Smaller
    reporting company <span id="xdx_908_edei--EntitySmallBusiness_c20230501__20240131_zCKDpiAOOjK7"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-05-01to2024-01-31" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000031" name="dei:EntitySmallBusiness">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></td></tr>
